    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 172 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(The Kingdoms are Divided)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "After Gojoson fell,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "the Korean Peninsula was divided into threekingdoms:"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Goguryo, Baekje, and Shilla."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Later these three kingdoms united as a single nation"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and referred to it as the Shilla Kingdom."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "The Shilla Kingdom was the most powerful"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "in the middle of the 8th century."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "It was called the Golden Age of Korean History."
    },
